        "name": null,
        "patch_url": null
      },
      "body": "```\n        // P2SH-P2WPKH only. BIP141 requires scriptSig to be exactly one push of the\n        // redeem script; extra opcodes make the spend invalid. EvalScript +\n        // DUMMY_CHECKER is therefore safe here: it only peels that push. The pubkey\n        // is witness.stack.back(), which is covered by the signature.\n        // Contrast P2PKH above, where scriptSig is malleable and must not be evaluated.\n```",
      "created_at": "2026-09-25T19:46:56Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-25T19:57:52Z",
